From dbe95e816ec80cae319185fb6936f4c94702cea6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mstsc-wine <mstsc-wine@localhost>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:54:06 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 14/43] credui: Implement CredUIPromptForWindowsCredentialsW
 and authentication buffer packing.

Credentials are packed as KERB_INTERACTIVE_UNLOCK_LOGON with offset-based string
buffers.  The prompt reuses the CredUIPromptForCredentialsW dialog.

Co-Authored-By: Andrew J. Moore <andrew@forevermoore.net>
---
 dlls/credui/Makefile.in    |   2 +-
 dlls/credui/credui_main.c  | 239 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 dlls/credui/tests/credui.c |  49 ++++++++
 3 files changed, 271 insertions(+), 19 deletions(-)

